flowchart TD
    Preview[Separate preview entry] --> Main[Existing Main composition]
    Main --> Session[One GameSession and simulation clock]
    Session --> Pose[Session manager pose]
    Pose --> Legacy[Legacy map adapter disabled in preview]
    Pose <--> Body[Single CharacterBody3D]
    Body --> Cameras[First eye / third spring arm]
    Session --> UI[Existing persistent management]
    Session --> Policy[BattlefieldPresentation permitted markers]
    Policy --> RTS[Independent RTS camera / inspection]
    Input[Input owner] --> Modal[Modal then management]
    Input --> Draft[Uncommitted preview]
    Draft --> Geometry[Construction footprint / door / validity]
    Input --> World[Rear look or RTS]
    Geometry --> Display[3D display only: no place command]
